// merge_version_increment.proto — how a merge onto agent-repl's own master
// moves the version, and the refusals about it. Shared by every way a merge is
// asked for: a workspace landing itself (MergeWorkspace) and an async merge
// (CreateWorkspaceAsyncMerge).
//
// WHICH MERGES CARRY ONE. A merge that lands on the default branch of the
// daemon's own repository (agent-repl's master) and was asked for by a
// workspace's agent must carry an increment, and is refused as
// `version_increment_required` without it; one the user asks for may carry it
